# Gems that come and go, and a keeper that learns of it: a maker adds a gem
# each tick, a reaper takes the gem from an even one and destroys one that
# divides by three, and the keeper counts what was added, what was removed
# with the values it held, and what was destroyed.
program relics.kest

component 8c1f4a3e-2b6d-4e97-a0c5-7d3e9f1b2a64 relics.gem Gem
component 5e2a9c71-4d08-4b3f-8e16-c9a7d2f05b38 relics.maker Maker
component f3b74d26-91e5-4c0a-b7d8-2e6a1c9f4053 relics.keeper Keeper

system relics.make simulation make write relics.maker
system relics.reap simulation reap read relics.gem entities after relics.make
system relics.watch simulation watch write relics.keeper after relics.reap added relics.gem removed relics.gem destroyed

spawn 1 relics.gem value=100
spawn 1 relics.gem value=101
spawn 1 relics.maker
spawn 1 relics.keeper
